### Create a habit
POST http://localhost:3000/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Meditation", "goal_value": 20, "goal_unit": "minutes", "goal_period": "day"}

### Get all habits
GET http://localhost:3000/habits

### Get today's habits with checks
GET http://localhost:3000/habits/today

### Get a habit by id
GET http://localhost:3000/habits/1

### Delete a habit
DELETE http://localhost:3000/habits/1

### Create a check for a habit
POST http://localhost:3000/habits/1/checks
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 20, "checked_at": "2026-03-20T08:00:00+00:00"}

### Get checks for a habit
GET http://localhost:3000/habits/1/checks

### Update a check
PUT http://localhost:3000/habits/1/checks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 15}
